emy/question-capture/13974828/state.json" "file_sha256" "46d566ee65bb8b9943a7d958e0dc303130cb027fe97b73a3ddbe0e713676bcac" "basis" 789 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974828/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-9961" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "Any real number"] "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974828/state.json" "file_sha256" "46d566ee65bb8b9943a7d958e0dc303130cb027fe97b73a3ddbe0e713676bcac" "basis" 789 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974828/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-9961" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "5"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974828/state.json" "file_sha256" "46d566ee65bb8b9943a7d958e0dc303130cb027fe97b73a3ddbe0e713676bcac" "basis" 789 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13974828/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-9838" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $F$ given below?\n\n- $det(F)=0$\n- $F$ is a singular matrix\n- $det(F)=-2$\n\n$$\nF=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 7 & 8\\end{aligned}]\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013865/state.json" "file_sha256" "c4d9f2d260fa3f739857d232731bcd3159a45e84744b703b6868b58f255c6dbd" "basis" 1176 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013865/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-9838" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(F) & =|\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 & 2 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 7 & 8\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =0|\\begin{aligned}4 & 5 \\\\ 7 & 8\\end{aligned}|-1|\\begin{aligned}3 & 5 \\\\ 6 & 8\\end{aligned}|+2|\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 \\\\ 6 & 7\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =0-1(24-30)+2(21-24) \\\\  & =0-1\\cdot (-6)+2\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =6-6 \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(F)=0$, the matrix is singular. \n\nTherefore, only statements I and II are true." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013865/state.json" "file_sha256" "c4d9f2d260fa3f739857d232731bcd3159a45e84744b703b6868b58f255c6dbd" "basis" 1176 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013865/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-9838" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013865/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "a73242ecd7ed590bf056c7669b70e01b3096d8fc1d262d117df45a05c5916e88" "basis" 1176 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013865/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-9838" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013865/state.json" "file_sha256" "c4d9f2d260fa3f739857d232731bcd3159a45e84744b703b6868b58f255c6dbd" "basis" 1176 "verification" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14013865/edb-import/verification.json"} {"question" "q-9838" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer/value" "value" [:answer.type/text "I